OL,3,GNEWSABell ringer makes 'ap-peal' for
OL,4,Amore volunteers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA devoted bell ringer is ap-pealing for
OL,7,Fmore volunteers to learn the ropes and
OL,8,Fclaims mastering the skill is no
OL,9,Fdifferent to learning to drive.
OL,11,FBob Dennis, 81, is the tower captain at
OL,12,FSt Mary's Church, Higham Ferrers,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, and has clocked up 64
OL,14,Fyears in the art of campanology.
OL,16,FHe said he had joined fellow bell
OL,17,Fringers and rung in churches in the US,
OL,18,FSouth Africa, Australia, New Zealand
OL,19,Fand the Netherlands, as it was "the
OL,20,Fsame technique wherever you go".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
